ruits.", "Mirelon_appearance": "Indigo-black skin with white powdery bloom, creating a visually striking contrast."}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "Its flesh is a vivid saffron-yellow due to a pigment called nivellin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bc412a031427a5f0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Mirelon_flesh\", \"value\": \"Vivid saffron-yellow flesh due to nivellin pigment.\"}", "result": "Key 'Mirelon_flesh' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The topic is fruits.", "Mirelon_appearance": "Indigo-black skin with white powdery bloom, creating a visually striking contrast.", "Mirelon_flesh": "Vivid saffron-yellow flesh due to nivellin pigment."}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "Nivellin is what gives the mirelon its signature yellow color.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-be75ea4c281053d8", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Mirelon_flesh\", \"value\": \"Vivid saffron-yellow flesh due to nivellin pigment.\"}", "result": "Key 'Mirelon_flesh' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The topic is fruits.", "Mirelon_appearance": "Indigo-black skin with white powdery bloom, creating a visually striking contrast.", "Mirelon_flesh": "Vivid saffron-yellow flesh due to nivellin pigment."}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "Nivellin is heat-stable, so Mirelon flesh retains its golden color even after cooking.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9d152c0220e03603", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Mirelon_flesh\", \"value\": \"Saffron-yellow flesh due to heat-stable nivellin pigment, retaining color after cooking.\"}", "result": "Key 'Mirelon_flesh' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The topic is fruits.", "Mirelon_appearance": "Indigo-black skin with white powdery bloom, creating a visually striking contrast.", "Mirelon_flesh": "Saffron-yellow flesh due to heat-stable nivellin pigment, retaining color after cooking."}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_tex