mselves leaning forward without quite realizing it.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-903c84e4e13707e2", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"observation\", \"value\": \"watching matches provides better rhythm sense and creates an immersive experience for spectators\"}", "result": "Key 'observation' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience", "governance": "Velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council", "observation": "watching matches provides better rhythm sense and creates an immersive experience for spectators"}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "It has the kind of quiet intensity that keeps people coming back to watch, even if they never step onto the mat themselves.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b86be5b1b7756889", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"observation\", \"value\": \"watching matches provides rhythm sense, immersive experience, and a quiet intensity\"}", "result": "Key 'observation' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience", "governance": "Velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council", "observation": "watching matches provides rhythm sense, immersive experience, and a quiet intensity"}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Even seasoned fans tend to describe it as more absorbing in person than any clip or photo manages to capture, and gyms that host open practice sessions often draw a small crowd of onlookers just for that reason.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-be8a60a24fb9b066", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"observation\", \"value\": \"watching matches provides rhythm sense, immersive experience, and is more absorbing in person\"}", "result": "Key 'observation' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience", "governance": "Velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council", "observation": "watching matches provides rhythm sense, immersive experience, and is more absorbing in person"}}]}, "final_kv": {"Velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience", "governance": "Velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council", "observation": "watching matches provides rhythm sense, immersive experience, and is more absorbing in person"}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 1,2\nQuestion 2: 5\nQuestion 3: 1\nQuestion 4: 4\nQuestion 5: 1,2\nPassage Difficulty: 3\nQuestion Difficulty: 2", "parsed_answers": {"1": [1, 2], "2": [5], "3": [1], "4": [4], "5": [1, 2]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 3, "question": 2}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QMA01", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the style of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Velthrak is a grappling-focused art", "2": "Velthrak does not permit striking of any kind", "3": "Velthrak is a striking-focused art", "4": "Velthrak allows limited strikes during competition", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes the governing body of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak certification", "2": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1967", "3": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1947", "4": "The Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts governs velthrak certification", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA04", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Full-resistance sparring involves kicking and punching", "2": "Practitioners must complete 200 strikes on a bag before each session", "3": "Practitioners must practice for three years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "4": "Practitioners must practice for two years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [4], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA05", "question": "Which of the following are restrictions that apply in velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Striking an opponent in any form is against the rules", "2": "A person who has practiced velthrak for one year cannot engage in full-resistance sparring", "3": "The sornek may only be performed in championship-level bouts", "4": "All competition surfaces must be approved by the Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 21, "per_statement_total": 25, "per_statement_accuracy": 0.84, "exact_match_correct": 3, "exact_match_total": 5, "exact_match_accuracy": 0.6, "slot_utilization": 1.0}}
{"id": "wm_application_listening_qa:C2-stream:r1:martial_arts:repeat_short", "condition_id": "C2-stream", "condition_name": "Human cognitive limits framing (streaming encode) (sentence-segmented)", "segment_unit": "sentence", "repeat_index": 1, "topic_id": "martial_arts", "title": "Martial Arts — Velthrak", "level": "repeat_short", "encoding_log": {"content": ["Topic: martial arts", "Velthrak is a grappling art where no striking of any kind is permitted.", "Competitors win by throwing their opponent on the ground and pinning them, and are not allowed to punch, kick, or elbow.", "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "It's the technique every velthrak practitioner is best known for.", "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "Since its 1947 founding, the Dalviri Arts Council has set grades, licensed instructors, and overseen all sanctioned competition worldwide."], "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-be010110a4eb2448", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\", \"value\": \"martial arts\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b52a2eca868326d9", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"grappling art with no striking permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8e6a6f00143ac9fc", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak_win\", \"value\": \"win by throwing opponent and pinning them\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak_win' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-95ce25419eb7f502", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9ae60098bf5fa45c", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"signature sweeping hip throw finishing in a floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-92d61c7648c27513", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"sweeping hip throw driving hip beneath center of mass to floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a071f70b26c7bee4", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"most famous technique for velthrak practitioners, sweeping hip throw to floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-857359d63dfe65d1", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9f246f6e7f2773d1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a0efe846083b876b", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"full-resistance sparring requires two years experience to ensure solid defensive technique\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a759acb03e222e1a", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8fd2b553fae0b7a7", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"origin\", \"value\": \"Originates in the Dalviri Highlands\"}", "result": "Key 'origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-be5976a33f726bf4", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Governed by Dalviri Arts Council, founded 1947\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-aa43df8a1f192d7c", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b6229e8c3f3f898f", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Governed by Dalviri Arts Council, founded 1947\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-923167585325d6ed", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) sets grades, licenses instructors, and oversees worldwide competition\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}], "final_kv": {"Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "origin": "Originates in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) sets grades, licenses instructors, and oversees worldwide competition"}, "segments_log": [{"segment_index": 1, "segment_text": "Topic: martial arts", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-be010110a4eb2448", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\", \"value\": \"martial arts\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts"}}, {"segment_index": 2, "segment_text": "Velthrak is a grappling art where no striking of any kind is permitted.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b52a2eca868326d9", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"grappling art with no striking permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking permitted"}}, {"segment_index": 3, "segment_text": "Competitors win by throwing their opponent on the ground and pinning them, and are not allowed to punch, kick, or elbow.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8e6a6f00143ac9fc", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak_win\", \"value\": \"win by throwing opponent and pinning them\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak_win' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-95ce25419eb7f502", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them"}}, {"segment_index": 4, "segment_text": "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9ae60098bf5fa45c", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"signature sweeping hip throw finishing in a floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sornek": "signature sweeping hip throw finishing in a floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-92d61c7648c27513", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"sweeping hip throw driving hip beneath center of mass to floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sornek": "sweeping hip throw driving hip beneath center of mass to floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "It's the technique every velthrak practitioner is best known for.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a071f70b26c7bee4", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"most famous technique for velthrak practitioners, sweeping hip throw to floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sornek": "most famous technique for velthrak practitioners, sweeping hip throw to floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-857359d63dfe65d1", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9f246f6e7f2773d1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience"}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a0efe846083b876b", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"full-resistance sparring requires two years experience to ensure solid defensive technique\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_sn