ir opponent on the ground and pinning them, and are not allowed to punch, kick, or elbow.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bb94a3f2429e8ddb", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak_win\", \"value\": \"win by throwing opponent and pinning them\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak_win' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bde3c7e5b6ff9d90", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them"}}, {"segment_index": 4, "segment_text": "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a017069ec1863159", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"signature sweeping hip throw finishing in a floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sornek": "signature sweeping hip throw finishing in a floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-86da415d183ae4b2", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"sweeping hip throw driving hip beneath center of mass to floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sornek": "sweeping hip throw driving hip beneath center of mass to floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "It's the technique every velthrak practitioner is best known for.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-89b36720ebcd1ece", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"most famous technique for velthrak practitioners, sweeping hip throw to floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sornek": "most famous technique for velthrak practitioners, sweeping hip throw to floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a1511a4c20f7d4b6", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-948cd9ad01641939", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience"}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a1964cee86a8db64", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"full-resistance sparring requires two years experience to ensure solid defensive technique\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires two years experience to ensure solid defensive technique"}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-abaaab8b2fc2b742", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-be6f4306a5204cb2", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"origin\", \"value\": \"Originates in the Dalviri Highlands\"}", "result": "Key 'origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-94cf9f894c40ef81", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Governed by Dalviri Arts Council, founded 1947\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9af70d9c8419767b", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-aa5f159c5770c31a", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Governed by Dalviri Arts Council, founded 1947\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "origin": "Originates in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "Governed by Dalviri Arts Council, founded 1947"}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "Since its 1947 founding, the Dalviri Arts Council has set grades, licensed instructors, and overseen all sanctioned competition worldwide.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8d5288a0720126d3", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) sets grades, licenses instructors, and oversees worldwide competition\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "origin": "Originates in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) sets grades, licenses instructors, and oversees worldwide competition"}}]}, "final_kv": {"Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "origin": "Originates in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) sets grades, licenses instructors, and oversees worldwide competition"}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 1,2\nQuestion 2: 5\nQuestion 3: 1,3\nQuestion 4: 5\nQuestion 5: 1\nPassage Difficulty: 3\nQuestion Difficulty: 4", "parsed_answers": {"1": [1, 2], "2": [5], "3": [1, 3], "4": [5], "5": [1]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 3, "question": 4}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QMA01", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the style of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Velthrak is a grappling-focused art", "2": "Velthrak does not permit striking of any kind", "3": "Velthrak is a striking-focused art", "4": "Velthrak allows limited strikes during competition", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of 