\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a0eafdd138079f1f", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) sets grades, licenses instructors, and oversees competitions.\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b0705f3d92cc4636", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) governs via its founding charter.\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}], "final_kv": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "origin": "originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) governs via its founding charter."}, "segments_log": [{"segment_index": 1, "segment_text": "Topic: martial arts", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b9741ba35a210b1f", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\", \"value\": \"martial arts\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts"}}, {"segment_index": 2, "segment_text": "Velthrak is a grappling art where no striking of any kind is permitted.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a86b89e3202b7016", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"grappling art with no striking permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking permitted"}}, {"segment_index": 3, "segment_text": "Competitors win by throwing their opponent on the ground and pinning them, and are not allowed to punch, kick, or elbow.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8ddc5ef7a1927e81", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak_win\", \"value\": \"win by throwing opponent and pinning them\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak_win' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b5e267dc97e38569", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"grappling art; no punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; no punching, kicking, or elbowing permitted", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them"}}, {"segment_index": 4, "segment_text": "Striking is off-limits at every level of competition, from practice rounds to sanctioned finals.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8a8300989d38163e", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them"}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-804e9947772941ab", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"signature move; sweeping hip throw finishing in a floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sornek": "signature move; sweeping hip throw finishing in a floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-87bd6d21b584413e", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"signature move; hip throw driving beneath center of mass to floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sornek": "signature move; hip throw driving beneath center of mass to floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "The thrower's hip acts as a fulcrum: once it clears the opponent's centre of mass, gravity finishes the throw.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a287790e1af50f9f", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"hip throw using hip as fulcrum to drive beneath center of mass\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sornek": "hip throw using hip as fulcrum to drive beneath center of mass"}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "No other velthrak technique is as recognizable.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-aa777e9206a61043", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"most recognizable velthrak technique; hip throw using hip as fulcrum\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "Velthrak_win": "win by throwing opponent and pinning them", "sornek": "most recognizable velthrak technique; hip throw using hip as fulcrum"}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bf631f613f883e46", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-adbe65a52f2cce97", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak_win\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak_win' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ae280add5398ace1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "sornek": "most recognizable velthrak technique; hip throw using hip as fulcrum", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience"}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-89bd19ff91e4b55b", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"full-resistance sparring requires two years experience to ensure solid defensive technique\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "sornek": "most recognizable velthrak technique; hip throw using hip as fulcrum", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires two years experience to ensure solid defensive technique"}}, {"segment_index": 11, "segment_text": "Coaches enforce the two year restriction strictly — no exceptions are made regardless of size or prior combat experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b448197185bf839c", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"full-resistance sparring requires two years experience; strictly enforced regardless of size or background\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "sornek": "most recognizable velthrak technique; hip throw using hip as fulcrum", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires two years experience; strictly enforced regardless of size or background"}}, {"segment_index": 12, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a3e6c8f2e9661850", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b7bccb715946161e", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"origin\", \"value\": \"originated in the Dalviri Highlands\"}", "result": "Key 'origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-92cbf6cd5427e7d1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"governed by Dalviri Arts Council, founded 1947\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8ce11573b7e563e1", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b59729965ad85c58", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"governed by Dalviri Arts Council, founded 1947\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "origin": "originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "governed by Dalviri Arts Council, founded 1947"}}, {"segment_index": 13, "segment_text": "Since its 1947 founding, the Dalviri Arts Council has set grades, licensed instructors, and overseen all sanctioned competition worldwide.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a0eafdd138079f1f", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) sets grades, licenses instructors, and oversees competitions.\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "origin": "originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) sets grades, licenses instructors, and oversees competitions."}}, {"segment_index": 14, "segment_text": "The Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter is the sole governing document for all certification to this day.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b0705f3d92cc4636", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) governs via its founding charter.\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "origin": "originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) governs via its founding charter."}}]}, "final_kv": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art; striking off-limits at all competition levels", "origin": "originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "Dalviri Arts Council (est. 1947) governs via its founding charter."}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 1,2\nQuestion 2: 5\nQuestion 3: 1,3\nQuestion 4: 5\nQuestion 5: 1\nPassage Difficulty: 3\nQuestion Difficulty: 4", "parsed_answers": {"1": [1, 2], "2": [5], "3": [1, 3], "4": [5], "5": [1]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 3, "question": 4}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QMA01", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the style of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Velthrak is a grappling-focused art", "2": "Velthrak does not permit striking of any kind", "3": "Velthrak is a striking-focused art", "4": "Velthrak allows limited strikes during competition", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes the governing body of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak certification", "2": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1967", "3": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1947", "4": "The Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts governs velthrak certification", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA04", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Full-resistance sparring involves kicking and punching", "2": "Practitioners must complete 200 strikes on a bag before each session", "3": "Practitioners must practice for three years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "4": "Practitioners must practice for two years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [4], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA05", "question": "Which of the following are restrictions that apply in velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Striking an opponent in any form is against the rules", "2": "A person who has practiced velthrak for one year cannot engage in full-resistance sparring", "3": "The sornek may only be performed in championship-level bouts", "4": "All competition surfaces must be approved by the Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 19, "per_statement_total": 25, "per_statement_accuracy": 0.76, "exact_match_correct": 2, "exact_match_total": 5, "exact_match_accuracy": 0.4, "slot_u