ks, and elbow strikes", "scoring": "three judges use majority-decision rule to resolve split verdicts"}, "segments_log": [{"segment_index": 1, "segment_text": "Topic: martial arts", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bc15aef9df10d907", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\", \"value\": \"martial arts\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts"}}, {"segment_index": 2, "segment_text": "Velthrak is a grappling art where striking of any kind is not permitted.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9ed361e7f114a134", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"grappling art where striking is not permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art where striking is not permitted"}}, {"segment_index": 3, "segment_text": "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-aaad6432614a261e", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\", \"value\": \"sweeping hip throw finishing in a floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art where striking is not permitted", "sornek": "sweeping hip throw finishing in a floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 4, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-adcf47f5971fe3e8", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art where striking is not permitted", "sornek": "sweeping hip throw finishing in a floor pin", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience"}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b4b7394e40e4dc34", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"origin\", \"value\": \"Velthrak originated in the Dalviri Highlands\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8aa9cafc0458d9c5", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8078bbd8e2c86eda", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-aa2620c916370759", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sornek\"}", "result": "Key 'sornek' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9d9d94c0129a08ea", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\", \"value\": \"Velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted", "sparring_rule": "full-resistance sparring requires at least two years of experience", "governance": "Velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council"}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "A related striking art from a neighboring region is kestro, built around punches, kicks, and elbow strikes rather than throws.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-863928417e52e4a8", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b95565263dc5286b", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"kestro\", \"value\": \"striking art from neighboring region using punches, kicks, and elbow strikes\"}", "result": "Key 'kestro' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted", "governance": "Velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region using punches, kicks, and elbow strikes"}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "Bouts are scored on a ten-point system: a clean strike to the torso earns two points, a strike to the head earns three, and a knockdown scores a full five, with judges deducting a point for any strike below the waist.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-81009370eb7672d1", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"governance\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b932d9ec3692e085", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"scoring\", \"value\": \"ten-point system with specific points for torso, head, and knockdowns\"}", "result": "Key 'scoring' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region using punches, kicks, and elbow strikes", "scoring": "ten-point system with specific points for torso, head, and knockdowns"}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "Fighters are classified into five weight tiers, and each tier has its own minimum number of sanctioned bouts required before a fighter can be ranked nationally.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b155a5bf03af789d", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"scoring\"}", "result": "Key 'scoring' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-92e48d59e965e490", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"weight_tiers\", \"value\": \"five weight tiers with minimum bouts required for national ranking\"}", "result": "Key 'weight_tiers' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region using punches, kicks, and elbow strikes", "weight_tiers": "five weight tiers with minimum bouts required for national ranking"}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Matches run three rounds of two minutes each, separated by a mandatory ninety-second rest interval.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-82a036ad9761be46", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"weight_tiers\"}", "result": "Key 'weight_tiers' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8aa791f0dd85537c", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"match_format\", \"value\": \"three 2-minute rounds with 90-second rest intervals\"}", "result": "Key 'match_format' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region using punches, kicks, and elbow strikes", "match_format": "three 2-minute rounds with 90-second rest intervals"}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "Judges score each bout independently and submit tallies to a central scoring table, where a majority-decision rule resolves any split verdict among the three officials.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-815ee7af6bafc019", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"scoring\", \"value\": \"three judges use majority-decision rule to resolve split verdicts\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9ba10a2f198df9c0", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"match_format\"}", "result": "Key 'match_format' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9e87911131dcf3c5", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"scoring\", \"value\": \"three judges use majority-decision rule to resolve split verdicts\"}", "result": "Key 'scoring' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region using punches, kicks, and elbow strikes", "scoring": "three judges use majority-decision rule to resolve split verdicts"}}]}, "final_kv": {"topic": "martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands where striking is not permitted", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region using punches, kicks, and elbow strikes", "scoring": "three judges use majority-decision rule to resolve split verdicts"}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 1,2\nQuestion 2: 5\nQuestion 3: 5\nQuestion 4: 5\nQuestion 5: 1,2\nPassage Difficulty: 3\nQuestion Difficulty: 5", "parsed_answers": {"1": [1, 2], "2": [5], "3": [5], "4": [5], "5": [1, 2]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 3, "question": 5}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QMA01", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the style of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Velthrak is a grappling-focused art", "2": "Velthrak does not permit striking of any kind", "3": "Velthrak is a striking-focused art", "4": "Velthrak allows limited strikes during competition", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes the governing body of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak certification", "2": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1967", "3": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1947", "4": "The Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts governs velthrak certification", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA04", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Full-resistance sparring involves kicking and punching", "2": "Practitioners must complete 200 strikes on a bag before each session", "3": "Practitioners must practice for three years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "4": "Practitioners must practice for two years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [4], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA05", "question": "Which of the following are restrictions that apply in velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Striking an opponent in any form is against the rules", "2": "A person who has practiced velthrak for one year cannot engage in full-resistance sparring", "3": "The sornek may only be performed in championship-level bouts", "4": "All competition surfaces must be approved by the Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 17, "per_statement_total": 25, "per_statement_accuracy": 0.68, "exact_match_correct": 2, "exact_match_total": 5, "exact_match_accuracy": 0.4, "slot_utilization": 1.0}}
